<title>UK: Xerox Credit sets $200 mln exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Xerox Credit sets $200 mln exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following exchangeable bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   XEROX CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON   * 2.75-3.00 MATURITY    **   2002</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  *	   PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    *	   PREMIUM   * 22-25 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES    * TO BE PRICED. EXCHANGEABLE INTO XEROX CORP.</p>
<p>	   ** TWO-YEAR HARD NO CALL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
